  "README.md": "# my-app

Stack: Angular 22, TypeScript.

## Getting started

\`\`\`bash
npm install
npm run dev
\`\`\`

## Scripts

- \`npm run ng\`
- \`npm run build\`
- \`npm run watch\`
- \`npm run typecheck\`

## Push to GitHub

Create an empty repository on GitHub, then:

\`\`\`bash
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/<your-username>/my-app.git
git push -u origin main
\`\`\`
