        Built with Next.js (App Router), React 19, TypeScript, Sass, Tailwind
        CSS, shadcn/ui, Redux Toolkit, Axios, Playwright, Vitest, Testing
        Library, ESLint, Prettier, Husky, lint-staged, SEO, llms.txt, GitHub
        Actions.
      </p>
    </section>
  );
}
