        Built with React 19, Vite, TypeScript, Sass, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui,
        Redux Toolkit, React Router, Axios, TanStack Query, TanStack Form, Zod,
        i18next, Playwright, Vitest, Testing Library, ESLint, Prettier, Husky,
        lint-staged, SEO, llms.txt, PWA, Storybook, GitHub Actions.
